-| "the 4B draft / second buffer, 627572736 B" | that buffer is **`cache_r_l0`** — the DFlash2 recurrent cache — not a draft-model weight buffer | same file, `plan order 0/1: cache_r_l0 627572736 B` |
+| "the 4B draft / second buffer, 627572736 B" | that buffer is **`cache_r_l0`** — the TARGET model's recurrent state (`src/llama-memory-recurrent.cpp:121`; no draft model in this cell), hot every token, and device-local in this cell — not a draft-model weight buffer (label corrected by the Fable check, CHECK-R51-FABLE.md finding 1) | same file, `plan order 0/1: cache_r_l0 627572736 B` |
 | spill order can sort by "bias/norm vectors, then late-layer FFN" | the planner's unit is a **buffer** (a ≤ 1 GiB run of consecutive tensors, `suballocation_block_size`), not a tensor. Norms and biases are a few MiB scattered inside mixed buffers; **no finer read-cost class exists to sort by at this granularity** | `30-planorder.txt`: 25 buffers, 24 of them ~1 GiB of layer weights |
 
